  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_WEAPON
    value: "<size=20>\n- User may select one of three weapons at any given time:
      axe, shield, arrow.\r\n- The selected weapon will be used to fight the Goblin
      when the Goblin feature is triggered. \r\n- Relative weapon strength is as
      follows."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
