  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>EXTRA BET</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_01
    value: <size=17>-  50% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to enable Epic Bonus
      Feature.
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_02_02
    value: <style=title><size=32>BONUS REELS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_02_02
    value: "<size=17>\n-  During Base Game, 3x5 Bonus Reels above Base Reels are
      played. \n\n-  Progress of Bonus Reels is saved per bet level.\n\n-  Bonus
      Reels are individual spinning reels.\n\n-  When empty Bonus Reels are played,
      a random combination of <br>   3           ,           , or            is guaranteed
      with the first spin.\n\n-  Landed symbols on the Bonus Reels are locked and
      carried to the Epic Bonus Feature.\n\n-  During Base Game, 1 to 3          
      ,           ,  or           on Bonus Reels can be upgraded randomly.\n\n- 
      After an Epic Bonus Feature, the Bonus Reels are reset to empty.\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_03_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>EPIC BONUS FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_01
    value: '<size=17>

      -  3 or more scattered            on Base Game reels
      triggers the Epic Bonus Feature.


      -  3 Epic Bonus Spins are awarded.


      - 
      Triggering           and any locked symbols from Bonus Reels are locked in
      position.


      -  All other positions turn into individual spinning reels.


      - 
      Epic Bonus Feature is played on 6 position high reels. 3 rows are initially
      active.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_02
    value: '<size=17>

      Row 6

      Row 5

      Row 4

      Row 3

      Row
      2

      Row 1'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_03
    value: "<size=21><align=center>\nRows 4 - 6 initially inactive\r\n\n\nRows 1
      - 3 initially active\r</align>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_03_04
    value: "<size=17>\n-  Any Epic Bonus symbols or Treasure Chest is activated only
      when its row is active.\r\n\n-  If additional Epic Bonus symbol or Treasure
      Chest land in an active position, the number of remaining Epic Bonus spins
      is reset to its maximum.\r\n\n-  When all active rows are full, the next adjacent
      inactive row is activated.\r\n\n-  When all 30 positions are full, special           
      is awarded which only gives Mega Jackpot or Grand Jackpot.\r"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_04_01
    value: <style=title><size=32>EPIC BONUS SYMBOLS</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_04_01
    value: '<size=17>

      -  Awards Credits.

